<metadata><name>Paulina Peak from Ten-Mile Sno-Park</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:282-3: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.707204" lon="-121.326816"><ele>1702.7</ele><name>Ten-Mile Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin (OSM way 306294846 Ten Mile Sno-Park); confidence: high; pdf_page: 283; book_elev_ft: 5600; quote: map 64: TEN-MILE SNO-PARK 5600'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.712347" lon="-121.277964"><ele>1934.6</ele><name>Paulina Lake outlet (road 21 bridge)</name><desc>source: OSM road 21 node 38373784 by the Paulina Creek crossing; no dam mapped in OSM, the creek leaves the lake about 200 m east (43.71326,-121.27563); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 284; book_elev_ft: 6331; quote: From the Paulina Lake outlet dam, just south of the resort, ski south and up Road 500</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.709529" lon="-121.273026"><ele>1936.9</ele><name>Road 21 / Road 500 junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 38580064 = start of USFS road 2100500 PAULINA PEAK (within 1 m); confidence: high; pdf_page: 283; quote: map 64: road 500 leaves road 21 east of the resort</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.689226" lon="-121.254786"><ele>2431.1</ele><name>Paulina Peak summit</name><desc>source: GNIS 1147505 (= OSM node 357313308); confidence: high; pdf_page: 284; book_elev_ft: 7897; quote: up Road 500 to the summit at 7,897 feet</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Paulina Peak from Ten-Mile Sno-Park</name><desc>1. Ten-Mile Sno-Park -&gt; Paulina Lake outlet (road 21 bridge): osm (high), 3.13 mi | 2. Paulina Lake outlet (road 21 bridge) -&gt; Road 21 / Road 500 junction: osm (high), 0.32 mi | 3. Road 21 / Road 500 junction -&gt; Paulina Peak summit: usfs-road (high), 3.88 mi</desc>
